I just played through a game where I found the artifact Eyes which grant 
Astral Vision, and I noticed a few oddities. One that was annoying is if 
I find a trap that's under some items, it makes the screen dark to show 
me where the trap is but my astral vision is still active (so I can't 
tell which item it's under). This looks like a bug to me.

I also played most of the game in Xorn form (wizard with polycontrol) 
and another issue came up: I can see items on the other side of walls, 
so I can hang out in the stone and cast Fireball and Cone of Cold into a 
room. I dunno if that's intended at all, but it sure made it easy to 
clear densely populated areas like Ludios and the castle.

One more thing: shouldn't xorns be able to go down whenever they want 
without digging pits? As if they're always flying over a hole or 
something. I think they should also get to pick up buried items (they're 
apparently always moving through the ground since when you unpoly you're 
in a pit) without digging.

